      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "stock should be trending up\nmarket/index should be trending up\nstock shouldn't be in sideways(it can be in sideways trend even after all strict momentum filters)\ndont take first trade after climax(when it goes out of keltner channel and comes back)\nonly take trade when trade generating ma is above main recent pivot",
