      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "title screen\nAscentfy presents [course name]\n\nhey everybody i am rupesh dalal,\nwelcome to Ascentfy [course name], In this course we are going to learn [this]\ntalk about why did you make this course\n\nlets look at what we are going to learn\n\nstart directly at 3/10 strategy\n    we them the indicator\n    good stock list\n    3 months free\n\nand in order to understand this strategy\n    we have to understand different indicators \n    and patterns used to create this indicator,\n    technical analysis and all about stock market\n\nso we are going to cover following topics in below order\n(read out loud and try to categorize \n    different topics into different sections)\n    ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "title screen\nAscentfy presents [course name]\n\nhey everybody i am rupesh dalal,\nwelcome to Ascentfy [course name], In this course we are going to learn [this]\ntalk about why did you make this course\n\nlets look at what we are going to learn\n\nstart directly at 3/10 strategy\n    we them the indicator\n    good stock list\n    3 months free\n\nand in order to understand this strategy\n    we have to understand different indicators \n    and patterns used to create this indicator,\n    technical analysis and all about stock market\n\nso we are going to cover following topics in below order\n(read out loud and try to categorize \n    different topics into different sections)\n    ",
